# Runtime DC list for a Tellomi build. Do not commit addresses.
# Format, one endpoint per line: dcId <ip> <port>
# Set TELLOMI_DC_CONFIG to this file when starting the process.
# The build refuses the Android emulator host, loopback, and Telegram Desktop's built-in DCs.
# It does not load Telegram's built-in RSA key. Without the server key, login cannot finish.
